cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "UAV vs. Bird Radar Tracks Dataset"
authors:
  - family-names: Mehta
    given-names: Varun
    affiliation: "University of Ottawa"
  - family-names: Bolic
    given-names: Miodrag
    affiliation: "University of Ottawa"
  - family-names: Mantegh
    given-names: Iraj
    affiliation: "National Research Council Canada"
  - family-names: Vidal
    given-names: Charles
    affiliation: "National Research Council Canada"
abstract: >-
  Real-world radar tracks of small UAVs (DJI Phantom 2, Phantom 4, Inspire,
  Mavic), birds, humans, and ground vehicles, collected with the Echodyne
  EchoGuard (MESA) radar at 10 Hz during eight field trials in Quebec, Canada
  (October 2019 - March 2021). Includes 1,117 expert-labeled tracks with 3D
  position, 3D velocity, azimuth/elevation/range, and RCS, plus full raw radar
  session logs.
keywords:
  - radar
  - UAV
  - drone
  - bird
  - counter-UAS
  - target classification
  - tracking
  - dataset
